    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petero na Yohaana nibatwarwa omu maiso g'Orukurato Rukuru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero na Yohaana obu bakaba nibakyabaza n'abantu, banyakatagara baabaizira baina omulinzi omukuru w'Enju ya Ruhanga hamu n'Abasadukaayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bbo babihiirwe habw'okuhurra Petero na Yohaana nibeegesa kandi nibarangirra okuhumbuuka kw'abafu okwatandikire na Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabakwata, baabalindira omu nkomo okuhika nyenkya, habwokuba bukaba bwizire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu baingi omuli abo abaahuliire enyegesa yabu bakaikiriza; n'omuhendo gw'abaikiriza gwayeyongera, gwahika nk'enkumi itaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu bwakiire nyenkya, abalemi baabo hamu n'abakuru b'enganda n'abeegesa b'ebiragiro bakeesorooleza Yerusaalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baina Annasi mukuru w'abanyakatagara, Kaayafa, Yohaana, Alekizanda, n'abandi boona ab'oruganda rw'omukuru wa banyakatagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baayemeriize abanyankomo hagati, baatandika kubakaguza bati: “Busobozi ki obubakoleze binu, rundi mubikozire omu ibara ly'oha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero, aijwire Mwoyo Ahikiriire, yabagarukamu ati: “Inywe abalemi b'abantu n'abakuru b'enganda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu muraaba nimutukaguza hati habw'ekikorwa ky'embabazi eki tukoliire omuntu ogu omulema kandi nkooku akiziibwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inywe inywena hamu n'abantu ba Isirairi boona mumanye ngu, omu ibara lya Yesu Kristo owa Nazareeti ou mwabambire hamusaraba, Ruhanga ou yahumbwire omu bafu, habw'Ogu, omusaija onu nikyo ayemereriire omu maiso ganyu akizire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 118:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ogu niryo ibaale inywe abombeki eri mwayangire, baitu niryo lyafookere bugumizo bw'enju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiharoho ondi asobora kutujuna, habwokuba busaho ibara lindi hansi y'iguru eryahairwe abantu erisobora kutujuna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petero na Yohaana nibalekerwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'orukurato obu baarozire obumanzi bwa Petero na Yohaana, kandi baabamanya nkooku bali bantu kwonka abateegesiibwe, baahunirra. Baabamanya nkooku bali nubo abakaba nibaikara na Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baarozire omusaija ayakiziibwe abeemeriire ha rubaju, baaburwa eki baraabahakaniza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kubaragira kuturuka aheeru, bbo bahanule bonka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibakaguzangana bati: “Abasaija banu tubakole ki? Habwokuba baakozire ekyamahano ekirangainwe kandi ekimanyirwe abantu boona abaikara Yerusaalemu, titukyasobora kukyehakana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonka habw'okukiculeeza kireke kweyongera kurangaanwa hoona omu bantu ka tubakange; balekere aho kugambira omuntu weena omu ibara eri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kweta abakwenda, baabateererra kutagaruka kugamba rundi kwegesa omu ibara lya Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Petero na Yohaana baabagarukamu bati: “Na inywe mukicwemu, obu kiraaba kihikire omu maiso ga Ruhanga itwe okubahurra okukira Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonka, ebi twarozire n'ebi twahuliire titusobora kubiculerra.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'orukurato baayongera kubakanga, hanyuma baabalekera, habw'okuburwa obulyo obu baraabafubirraho. Kandi abantu boona bakaba nibakugiza Ruhanga habw'eki ekyabaireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamanya omusaija ogu ayakozirweho ekyamahano eki eky'okukizibwa, nkooku akaba ahingwize emyaka makumi ana ey'obukuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaikiriza nibasaba Ruhanga obumanzi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero na Yohaana obu baalekiirwe, baagenda hali ab'ekitebe kyabu, baabamanyisa byona banyakatagara abakuru n'abakuru b'enganda ebi baabagambiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
