          "text": "Ekitebe kyona eky'abaikiriza bakaba baina omutima gumu n'omwoyo gumu. Hakaba hataroho n'omu omuli bo ayagizire ngu, byona ebi yatungire bye wenka; baitu byona bikaba biri by'abo boona.",
