        {
          "text": "Hakaba haroho omusaija ow'oruganda rwa Leevi, enzaarwa ya Kipuro, arukwetwa Yosefu, abakwenda ou baayesire Baranaba (amakuru gaalyo: Mwekambisa). ",
          "type": "text",
